  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_PrivacySpeech_Contribution_Protection\Text:
    Candidate Language=KM-KH: វិធី​ដែល​យើង​ការពារ​ឯកជនភាព​របស់​អ្នក
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Priority_List\Content:
